Santa Cruz Trek is one of South America’s classic high-altitude hikes, a four-day journey through Peru’s spectacular Cordillera Blanca where glacial lakes, towering snow-capped peaks, and the dramatic Punta Unión Pass combine to create some of the Andes’ most breathtaking scenery.

